WEBVTT

00:25.576 --> 00:28.197
There was a boy I used to be

00:31.478 --> 00:34.578
Who saw the world so simply

00:36.879 --> 00:39.859
Thought every road was straight and true

00:39.879 --> 00:42.660
Beneath the sky of perfect blue

00:48.803 --> 00:54.811
He thought that love was just a phrase

00:54.851 --> 00:58.657
for sunny easy golden days

01:00.659 --> 01:05.907
He called you all his guiding stars before he

01:06.027 --> 01:12.676
knew about the scars But I learned the sky can

01:12.736 --> 01:18.702
fall away and turn a bright and sunny day to grey

01:20.644 --> 01:24.568
And in the static and the night you were my only

01:24.629 --> 01:29.767
guiding light, more than a feeling More than a

01:29.807 --> 01:35.075
name You were the fire, you were the flame That

01:35.135 --> 01:38.821
led me through the pouring rain And brought me

01:38.901 --> 01:40.764
back to life again

02:06.198 --> 02:09.500
I learned to wear a painted smile

02:12.100 --> 02:15.502
And walk a cold and lonely mile

02:17.802 --> 02:21.764
To build a wall of industrial sound On cold and

02:22.024 --> 02:24.425
unfamiliar ground

02:29.787 --> 02:32.988
I learned how silence has a way

02:35.865 --> 02:39.426
And how a heart can fill with hate

02:41.607 --> 02:48.209
I learned that trust can be a lie Beneath a cold

02:48.349 --> 02:53.611
and empty sky Two

02:53.691 --> 02:57.252
stars I hear held close and tight One shines a

02:57.292 --> 03:01.153
warm and distant light A friendly face on a

03:01.193 --> 03:02.073
glowing screen

03:05.257 --> 03:09.022
The miles can't ever come between The bond we

03:09.142 --> 03:13.367
made, the truth we know Helping a broken boy to

03:13.427 --> 03:19.614
grow And when the sky would fall away And turn a

03:19.714 --> 03:26.564
bright and sunny day to grey And in the static and

03:26.604 --> 03:30.949
the night you were my only guiding light More

03:31.009 --> 03:37.236
than a feeling, more than a name You were the

03:37.296 --> 03:40.940
fire, you were the flame That led me through the

03:41.000 --> 03:45.224
pouring rain And brought me back to life again

04:07.728 --> 04:08.248
Hello.

05:12.248 --> 05:13.128
Aum.

